      "writtenOn": "2024-12-10T18:26:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand why this property is useful. But most Loopers don\u0027t have slow logging at all, so reading this property eagerly will be a wasted effort.\nCan we read the property when slow log is set? For instance in `Looper#setSlowLogThresholdMs`?",
      "revId": "8a00e6123db232bc8aa1f38773594314b961b3b4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9d6290cc_7ae936b1",
